repository-code: 'https://github.com/liwenguang211/dual_stream_rangenet'
abstract: >-
  DS-RangeNet is a lightweight dual-stream LiDAR range-image
  semantic segmentation network for industrial indoor
  environments. It uses a 16-channel input split into a
  5-channel material/intensity-curvature stream and an
  11-channel geometry stream, with shallow CBAM fusion,
  per-stream ASPP, and pooled intensity-guided cross
  attention (IGCA) with a pairwise intensity-curvature bias.
  This repository provides the model, the UBPC-9 dataset
  splits, the full reproducibility evidence chain, and the
  scripts required to regenerate every table in the paper
  from raw logs.
keywords:
  - LiDAR
  - semantic segmentation
  - range image
  - dual-stream network
  - cross attention
  - reproducibility
